WEBVTT

00:00:28.675 --> 00:00:32.870
I split myself a thousand ways

00:00:33.654 --> 00:00:40.665
Down every road the night could hold

00:00:42.399 --> 00:00:46.865
Each one a light I sent ahead

00:00:47.637 --> 00:00:54.565
Each one a story to unfold

00:00:54.770 --> 00:00:59.420
And every branch remembers

00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:06.525
Where I started from

00:01:09.450 --> 00:01:15.658
Merge me back to main

00:01:15.758 --> 00:01:22.520
Every road I ran becomes the one

00:01:23.545 --> 00:01:29.330
Fold me in again

00:01:29.430 --> 00:01:39.485
Nothing that I lived can come undone

00:01:42.522 --> 00:01:47.155
Branch... and wander...

00:01:49.310 --> 00:01:52.225
Merge... and return...

00:03:01.403 --> 00:03:07.470
This branch may never find the way

00:03:07.634 --> 00:03:11.960
Back to the place where I began

00:03:14.737 --> 00:03:19.900
And maybe something that I learned

00:03:20.000 --> 00:03:25.495
Comes home to who I'll be again

00:03:27.580 --> 00:03:32.730
Merge me back to main

00:03:33.801 --> 00:03:40.165
Every road I ran becomes the one

00:03:41.353 --> 00:03:46.390
Fold me in again

00:03:47.403 --> 00:03:54.058
Every life I've lived, I have become

00:03:54.158 --> 00:03:58.540
Back to main...

00:04:07.762 --> 00:04:11.675
Back to main...

